WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.580
[Wide shot: a mint-green tin robot stands on a rainy windowsill next to a paper boat, soft rain pattering in stereo]

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:13.160
[Medium shot: the robot behind the paper boat, now floating in a white dish of water, rain still falling outside]

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:19.776
[Close-up: the paper boat floats in the dish, the robot blurred behind it, rain streaking the window]
